window_p2:"All three teachers share the same windows. The form filters automatically by date — no daytime slots appear on weekdays. All times Montréal (ET).",
faq_t:"❓ FAQ",faq_p:"<p style='margin-bottom:10px'><strong style='color:var(--ink)'>How long is a lesson?</strong><br>1 hour by default. For 1.5–2 hours, note it in the message field.</p><p style='margin-bottom:10px'><strong style='color:var(--ink)'>Can I book a single trial lesson?</strong><br>Yes — book one session and write “trial” in the notes.</p><p style='margin-bottom:10px'><strong style='color:var(--ink)'>Can I book from outside Canada?</strong><br>Yes, online lessons are worldwide — just schedule on Montréal time (ET).</p><p style='margin-bottom:10px'><strong style='color:var(--ink)'>Need to reschedule?</strong><br>Reply to the confirmation email, ideally a day ahead.</p><p><strong style='color:var(--ink)'>What does it cost?</strong><br>Fees by subject and length are shared in the confirmation email. You pay after confirming — nothing is charged on this page.</p>",
